Human: Can you tell me the steps to write an if/then statement in C programming language?

Assistant: Hello,  Can  you                                                                             Hello welcome to Programming C, this tutorial will cover the if and then statements in C.  

C is a structured language so it uses conditional programming.  

In C you can write if/then statements as so:

```
if (condition)
// do the work if condition is true

```

or

```
if (condition)
{
  // do the work
  result = function(parameters);
  return result;
}

```
